# The jobs image's own build context (BuildKit reads this instead of the repository's .dockerignore,
# which is the engine image's). Code and job configs only: no data, no secrets, no tests.
*
!src/
!scripts/v2/jobs.py
!scripts/v2/catalogue.py
!scripts/v2/registry.py
!config/jobs/
!config/audit.toml
!docker/jobs/requirements-cpu.txt
!docker/jobs/requirements-gpu.txt
**/__pycache__
